entries[173978] = { ["name"] = "Feast of Blood", ["text"] = "3 sec cast\nReagents:\nRaw Elekk Meat (10), Raw Boar Meat (10), Raw Talbuk Meat (10), Raw Riverbeast Meat (10), Rylak Egg (10), Raw Clefthoof Meat (10)\nRecipe for 4 servings. Actual number of servings will vary based on cooking skill. You may get a new recipe idea while cooking.\nProfession:\nDraenor Cooking (1)\nDiscovery:\nDraenor Cooking Recipes\n\nUse: Feed up to 30 people in your raid or party with a Feast of Blood.\n\nIn so doing, you have a chance to obtain the recipe.\n\nRestores 8173 health and ( 2125 / 5 * 20) mana over 20 sec. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 550 in your attuned stat for 1 hour.\n35" }
